	(text "POWER SUPPLY SECTION (LAB 1)\n- Assumed AC/DC Wall Adapter: Qualtek QAWA-24-12-US01 (12V DC, 2A, 5.5mm OD x 2.1mm ID Center-Positive, DigiKey QAWA-24-12-US01 or equivalent)\n- J1: 5.5mm x 2.1mm DC Barrel Jack (Center-Positive, Left Edge of PCB)\n- SW1: SPDT Power Slide Switch (Option B: Rated 1A-4A @ 28VDC/125VAC, Footprint: edu_sbc:SW_Slide_Power_SPDT)\n- D1: 1N5819 Schottky Reverse Voltage Protection Diode\n- C1: 220uF 25V Electrolytic Bulk Input Capacitor\n- C2: 100nF 50V Ceramic Input High-Frequency Bypass\n- U1: LM7805 TO-220 +5V Linear Regulator with Heatsink\n- C3: 0.33uF Regulator Input Stability Capacitor\n- C4: 47uF 16V Electrolytic Output Bulk Capacitor\n- C5: 100nF Ceramic Output Bypass Capacitor\n- D2: 1N4001 Regulator Reverse Discharge Protection Diode\n- R1: 1k 0.25W Resistor\n- D3: 3.0mm Green Power LED"
		(at 25.4 12.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000065010090")
	)
	(text "RESET SUPERVISOR & INVERTER SECTION (LAB 2)\n- U2: Dallas/Maxim DS1813-5+ (TO-92) Active-Low Reset Supervisor with Brown-Out\n- SW2: 6.0mm x 6.0mm Tactile Pushbutton Manual Reset Switch\n- C6: 100nF Ceramic Bypass Capacitor for U2\n- U3: 74HCT14 Hex Schmitt Trigger Inverter (DIP-14 Socketed)\n- U3A: Inverts nRESET to active-high RESET_HIGH (for 82C55 PPI & 16C550 UART)\n- U3B: Inverts active-high UART_INTR to active-low nUART_INT (for JP_INT)\n- U3C..U3F: Unused inputs tied directly to GND\n- C7: 100nF Ceramic Bypass Capacitor for U3 (Pin 14)"
		(at 25.4 82.55 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000065010091")
	)
	(text "DUAL CANNED TTL OSCILLATORS (LAB 2)\n- X1: 4.0000 MHz Canned TTL Oscillator (DIP-8 / DIP-14 Socketed) -> CPU_CLK\n- C8: 100nF Ceramic Bypass Capacitor for X1\n- X2: 1.8432 MHz Canned TTL Oscillator (DIP-8 / DIP-14 Socketed) -> UART_CLK\n- C9: 100nF Ceramic Bypass Capacitor for X2\n\nTEST POINTS PROVIDED:\n- TP1: GND (Multiple Scope Clip Loops)\n- TP2: +5V Test Point\n- TP3: CPU_CLK (4.0000 MHz)\n- TP4: UART_CLK (1.8432 MHz)\n- TP5: nRESET (Active Low)\n- TP6: RESET_HIGH (Active High)"
		(at 25.4 146.05 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000065010092")
	)
)
